abstract: "Every mind that works in a repository leaves, before switching off, what it understood. A constitution model with a right of reply, a testament rite, a register for human decisions, guardians that keep the charter honest, and a runner that appends only when a human runs it. Measured on two months of real use; the human half is measured, not proven."
